        "html": "=<h2>Preprocessing finished successfully</h2>\n<p>\nYour HuggingFace dataset has been preprocessed and uploaded to HuggingFace.\n</p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li><strong>Repository:</strong> {{ $json.repo_name }}</li>\n  <li><strong>Job ID:</strong> {{ $json.process_id }}</li>\n  <li><strong>Pages:</strong> {{ $json.total_pages }}</li>\n  <li><strong>Regions:</strong> {{ $json.total_regions }}</li>\n  <li><strong>Lines:</strong> {{ $json.total_lines }}</li>\n  <li><strong>Runtime:</strong> {{ $json.runtime }}s</li>\n</ul>\n<p>\nYou can access the dataset at <a href=\"https://huggingface.co/datasets/{{ $json.repo_name }}\">https://huggingface.co/datasets/{{ $json.repo_name }}</a>.\n</p>\n----\n<p>\n<small>Sent by the Flow preprocessing pipeline.</small>\n</p>",
